WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.567
-Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:05.734
You're here. You made it.
Thank you for watching at home.

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:06.968
I appreciate this.

00:00:06.968 --> 00:00:09.634
I'm very excited about this.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:14.200
The star
of "John Wick: Chapter 4,"

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.200
Keanu Reeves,
is my guest tonight.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:21.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.801
I knew Keanu was here

00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:25.234
when I saw 20 security guards
knocked out in the hallway.

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:27.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.968
Well, guys, it is that time
of year again.

00:00:28.968 --> 00:00:31.567
March Madness
has officially begun.

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:35.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:36.100
There's nothing more fun

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.801
than carefully filling out
your bracket

00:00:37.801 --> 00:00:39.100
and then losing to a coworker

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.300
who pronounces UCLA
as "uch-lah."

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:45.467
Congratulations.

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:50.434
Games are being played on CBS,
TBS, TNT, and TruTV.

00:00:50.434 --> 00:00:52.400
Unfortunately, by the time
you find TruTV,

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:53.901
all the games are over,
you know?

00:00:53.901 --> 00:00:55.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:56.334
Why are they still
calling it that?

00:00:56.334 --> 00:00:58.234
Just call it the
"Impractical Jokers" Network.

00:00:58.234 --> 00:01:00.234
Yeah, I know that.
-Come on.

00:01:00.234 --> 00:01:02.601
-I know that channel.

00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:03.801
TruTV.

00:01:03.801 --> 00:01:05.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:05.901 --> 00:01:07.234
But I heard that this year,

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:11.033
Americans will bet more than
$15 billion on March Madness.

00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:13.567
[ Crowd exclaims ]

00:01:13.567 --> 00:01:14.734
People are like,
"Hey, at this point,

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:16.234
it's safer than putting money
in the banks."

00:01:16.234 --> 00:01:18.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.767 --> 00:01:19.801
-Ka-ching!

00:01:19.801 --> 00:01:21.667
-I could win something
on this one.

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:22.901
The first big upset

00:01:22.901 --> 00:01:24.300
was the second game
of the tournament

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:28.734
when 13-seed Furman University
beat 4-seed Virginia.

00:01:28.734 --> 00:01:31.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:31.801 --> 00:01:33.033
It was a really exciting game,

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:35.167
and I noticed that
Furman's cheerleaders

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:36.400
had a pretty interesting chant.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:37.801
Watch this.

00:01:37.801 --> 00:01:39.701
-FU!

00:01:39.701 --> 00:01:42.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.267 --> 00:01:43.534
-FU.

00:01:43.534 --> 00:01:45.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:48.634
-Yeah.
-Furman University, yeah, yeah.

00:01:48.634 --> 00:01:51.100
-Yeah.
-I want to say it's innocent,

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:53.167
but they only chant that
when the other team scores.

00:01:53.167 --> 00:01:55.801
That's very interesting.
Just saying.

00:01:55.801 --> 00:01:56.934
Well, people are talking
about this.

00:01:56.934 --> 00:01:58.667
The Biden Administration
is ordering

00:01:58.667 --> 00:02:01.067
the Chinese parent company
of TikTok

00:02:01.067 --> 00:02:04.334
to either sell the app
or face a possible ban.

00:02:04.334 --> 00:02:05.334
[ Crowd oohs ]

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:07.400
It is a bold move by Biden.

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:10.367
If he bans TikTok, China will
only be able to spy on us

00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:11.934
with literally everything else.

00:02:11.934 --> 00:02:14.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.133
Man, if Biden actually does
ban TikTok,

00:02:16.133 --> 00:02:17.868
I'm pretty sure half the country
will be like --

00:02:17.868 --> 00:02:19.167
-FU!

00:02:19.167 --> 00:02:20.567
-Yeah, yeah.
-Oh!

00:02:20.567 --> 00:02:22.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:25.834
Furman University.

00:02:25.834 --> 00:02:27.601
-Yeah. Furman.

00:02:27.601 --> 00:02:29.701
-I love them. That's great.

00:02:29.701 --> 00:02:34.434
Guys, I read that Chris Christie
said in the next 45 to 60 days,

00:02:34.434 --> 00:02:37.367
he will announce whether or not
he's running for president.

00:02:37.367 --> 00:02:38.601
[ Crowd exclaims ]
-Oh.

00:02:38.601 --> 00:02:39.934
-When asked about making
a decision,

00:02:39.934 --> 00:02:41.534
Christie said, "Well,
we'll cross that bridge

00:02:41.534 --> 00:02:45.067
when we close it --
I mean, when we get to it.

00:02:45.067 --> 00:02:47.033
When we get to it, not --
I didn't say close.

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:48.367
They closed it?"

00:02:48.367 --> 00:02:51.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:52.834
Some business news --
Kellogg's announced

00:02:52.834 --> 00:02:55.167
that they're splitting
into two separate companies,

00:02:55.167 --> 00:02:58.167
one for cereal
and one for snacks.

00:02:58.167 --> 00:03:00.067
Right now, they're trying
to figure out who gets custody

00:03:00.067 --> 00:03:03.334
of Snap, Crackle, and Pop,
but we'll figure that out.

00:03:03.334 --> 00:03:05.567
Yep, cereal and snacks
are splitting up,

00:03:05.567 --> 00:03:08.033
but sadly, neither side
wants Cracklin' Oat Bran.

00:03:08.033 --> 00:03:09.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.968 --> 00:03:12.367
"I don't want to go
near that stuff."

00:03:12.367 --> 00:03:16.434
New snack company will be called
Kellanova.

00:03:16.434 --> 00:03:18.834
I actually have $100 on
Kellanova to win March Madness.

00:03:18.834 --> 00:03:20.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.467 --> 00:03:21.667
Listen to this, guys.

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:24.067
Spring break is in full swing
down in Miami Beach,

00:03:24.067 --> 00:03:26.467
and following noise complaints
from residents,

00:03:26.467 --> 00:03:28.901
a judge ruled that the city
can order bars

00:03:28.901 --> 00:03:32.267
to change their last call
from 5:00 a.m. to 2:00 a.m.

00:03:32.267 --> 00:03:34.667
-Ohhh.
-Yep.

00:03:34.667 --> 00:03:36.400
[ Crowd boos ]

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.801
Miami residents were mad.

00:03:37.801 --> 00:03:39.601
They were like, "You know,
when we bought this condo

00:03:39.601 --> 00:03:43.400
next to a Señor Frog's, we had
no idea it would be like this.

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:44.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.901 --> 00:03:47.434
No idea
that it would get rowdy!"

00:03:47.434 --> 00:03:49.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:49.267 --> 00:03:53.200
Señor Frog's!

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:56.601
And finally, New York City just
introduced brand-new subway cars

00:03:56.601 --> 00:04:01.200
with eight security cameras
in each car.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.400
And they're stolen.

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.534
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.901 --> 00:04:08.300
The city politely asked
that if you do commit a crime,

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:09.634
do it on one of those
five cars.

